","citation_id":"smp-1dc934bd25924d2d926bad8a72a24277:16","title":"运营素材库搭建教程，自媒体素材库搭建 新手运营搭建素材库，主要以有用为主，不要搞些花里胡哨的表格！每一个素材库都要对应具体的作用！素材库一个是用于选题灵感，一个是用于创作参考（素材、画面、内容形式等）","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694245727563780794","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694245727563780794","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0158","question_id":"CQ-Q0158","citation_id":"smp-1dc934bd25924d2d926bad8a72a24277:17","title":"美妆品牌 KOL 合作素材管理与授权:数字资产管理实战指南","raw_url":"https://www.musedam.cc/zh-CN/blog/kol-content-management-beauty-brands","normalized_url":"https://www.musedam.cc/zh-CN/blog/kol-content-management-beauty-brands","host":"www.musedam.cc","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0158","question_id":"CQ-Q0158","citation_id":"smp-1dc934bd25924d2d926bad8a72a24277:18","title":"Creative Asset Portal: Self-Serve Downloads for Affiliates","raw_url":"https://influencermarketinghub.com/creative-asset-portal-for-affiliates/","normalized_url":"https://influencermarketinghub.com/creative-asset-portal-for-affiliates/","host":"influencermarketinghub.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0158","question_id":"CQ-Q0158","citation_id":"smp-1dc934bd25924d2d926bad8a72a24277:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0158","question_id":"CQ-Q0158","citation_id":"smp-1dc934bd25924d2d926bad8a72a24277:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ